                "sender": "w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov",
                "senderName": "NWS Corpus Christi TX",
                "headline": "Coastal Flood Advisory issued October 12 at 9:24AM CDT until October 13 at 1:00AM CDT by NWS Corpus Christi TX",
                "description": "* WHAT...Minor coastal flooding.\n\n* WHERE...Coastal Aransas, Coastal Kleberg, Coastal Nueces,\nCoastal San Patricio, Aransas Islands, Coastal Refugio,\nCoastal Calhoun, Kleberg Islands, Nueces Islands and Calhoun\nIslands Counties.\n\n* WHEN...Until 1 AM CDT Tuesday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Flooding of lots, parks, and roads with only\nisolated road closures expected.",
                "instruction": "If travel is required, allow extra time as some roads may be\nclosed. Do not drive around barricades or through water of\nunknown depth. Take the necessary actions to protect flood-prone\nproperty.",
